# A smooth simple wave: one sine wave of 0.1 m on water 1 m deep over a flat
# bed, 10 m long, on 100 x 4 cells of 0.1 m, periodic in x and y. The water
# moves at (0.5, -0.3) m/s plus the velocity of the wave, which travels
# towards high x and does not break before 3.2 s; the run stops at 1 s
# (Docs/sphinx_doc/Verification.rst).
flume.n_cell        = 100 4
flume.prob_hi       = 10.0 0.4
flume.periodic      = 1 1
flume.max_grid_size = 32
flume.plot_file     = wave
flume.stop_time     = 1.0

flume.init.surface_elevation = 1.0
flume.init.wave_amplitude    = 0.1
flume.init.velocity          = 0.5 -0.3
